# Claude #2d: THE TUCKER in Tide. Deck in cells 11..10+n (cell 11 = top). Top card v is tucked to be the v-th card.
# Plays the deck 2 3 ... n 1 and prints n and the number of tucks (the proof says 2^(n-1)-1).
use stdlib
: n 1 dig ;
: card 10 + dig ;
: setcard 10 + bury ;
: tuck 1 card 5 bury 1 1 [ drop dup 1 + card over setcard 1 + dup 5 dig < ] drop drop 5 dig 5 dig setcard ;
: deal 1 1 [ drop dup 1 + over setcard 1 + dup n < ] drop drop 1 n setcard ;
: play 0 1 card 1 = 0 = [ drop tuck 1 + 1 card 1 = 0 = ] drop ;
: try 1 bury deal play n . . cr ;
2 try
3 try
5 try
8 try
10 try
